### Register user (Admin)
POST http://localhost:3001/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tenant.com",
  "password": "admin123",
  "name": "Admin User",
  "role": "Admin",
  "tenantId": "TENANT_ID_AQUI"
}

### Login user
POST http://localhost:3001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tenant.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### List templates (token required)
GET http://localhost:3001/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Create template (Admin/Editor)
POST http://localhost:3001/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "TENANT_ID_AQUI",
  "name": "Template Teste",
  "description": "Descrição do template"
}

### Publish template (Admin only)
POST http://localhost:3001/templates/TEMPLATE_ID_AQUI/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Get template by ID
GET http://localhost:3001/templates/TEMPLATE_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

